      "message": "R: limit RMScopies to tested parameters (RMScopies_tested), as suggested by U. Groemping\n\n- RMScopies_tested: 328 (q, m) combinations whose R output was verified\n  exhaustively (ca_verify.c from ca-tools; q = 19 via identity with verified arrays).\n- RMScopiesCA / N_RMScopiesCA only use tested combinations (smallest tested\n  m' >= m, then columns dropped); all 78 improved entries are covered.\n- RMScopies(q, m, tested_only = FALSE) for exploration.\n- Verification log: R-contribution/RMScopies_tested_verification.csv.\n- Tests: 81 expectations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016kJVGYEHcVo8hHYdVCWAbN",
