        "date": "2026-10-12T12:40:24Z"
      },
      "message": "Support prime powers q (GF(q) arithmetic): 18 more improved entries (v = 8, 9)\n\n- gf.py: GF(q) tables for q = p^n, field axioms checked exhaustively.\n- rms_base.py, construct_one_copy.py, construct_layers.py now work over GF(q);\n  for prime q the output is byte-identical to the previous version.\n- New verified arrays for v = 8 (k = 74-81) and v = 9 (k = 92-101);\n  improvements.csv now lists 78 entries.\n- README: complete proof (including the m = 1 case and prime powers).\n- R-contribution: RMScopies for prime powers via lhs::create_galois_field,\n  q = 2 guarded, tests extended (60 expectations), patch regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016kJVGYEHcVo8hHYdVCWAbN",
